1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,536
Verana.

2
00:00:00,536 --> 00:00:04,980
The open trust infrastructure for the verifiable internet.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,318
Verifiable credentials are becoming a reality.

4
00:00:09,318 --> 00:00:14,440
The foundations are laid: issuer, holder, verifier, one trust triangle.

5
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:23,240
And implementations are arriving in every sector: each ecosystem potentially bringing value to the entire digital economy.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,750
The next challenges: interconnect ecosystems.

7
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:30,833
Create new ones at will and monetize.

8
00:00:30,833 --> 00:00:32,417
Scale cross-border.

9
00:00:32,417 --> 00:00:34,250
Authenticate mutually.

10
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:36,750
And discover trusted services.

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,197
Scale, by creating ecosystems.

12
00:00:39,197 --> 00:00:53,110
How do we create new trust registries at will: publish schemas and accreditation lists, define business models, and make each ecosystem publicly discoverable, interconnectable, and joinable?

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,625
Scale, cross-border.

14
00:00:55,625 --> 00:01:01,800
How do we recognize and onboard ecosystems from any country, and any sector?

15
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,553
Mutual authentication.

16
00:01:03,553 --> 00:01:10,400
How do services and AI agents from different countries identify each other, and trust each other?

17
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,883
And finally, discovery.

18
00:01:12,883 --> 00:01:16,730
How do we search the graph of trusted services?

19
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,439
Verana answers all of this.

20
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:25,400
Sovereign ecosystems, verifiable identity, one public Trust Graph.

21
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:28,200
Open, neutral, owned by no one.

22
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:32,614
Build your own sovereign ecosystem trust registry.

23
00:01:32,614 --> 00:01:38,830
Publish your Ecosystem Governance Framework, your credential schemas, business models.

24
00:01:38,830 --> 00:01:41,432
Onboard your ecosystem participants.

25
00:01:41,432 --> 00:01:44,540
Your ecosystem exists, and is discoverable.

26
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,773
Then deploy your services and AI agents.

27
00:01:47,773 --> 00:01:49,714
Choose your business wallet.

28
00:01:49,714 --> 00:01:53,250
Join ecosystems, on Verana or on other trust lists.

29
00:01:53,250 --> 00:01:58,934
Attach their credentials to your services: you are now visible in the Trust Graph.

30
00:01:58,934 --> 00:02:05,520
And issue and verify credentials, to personal wallets, AI agents, or any service with a wallet.

31
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,698
You are now part of the Trust Graph.

32
00:02:08,698 --> 00:02:16,942
Any person, service, or AI agent can find you, mutually authenticate with verifiable credentials, and connect.

33
00:02:16,942 --> 00:02:20,240
Trust, established before the first message.

34
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:26,470
Behind Verana: open specifications, built exclusively on open standards.

35
00:02:26,470 --> 00:02:28,066
Open-source software.

36
00:02:28,066 --> 00:02:32,169
And a non-profit foundation, managed by its community.

37
00:02:32,169 --> 00:02:33,612
Want to contribute?

38
00:02:33,612 --> 00:02:37,335
Join the Foundation: it is free for contributors.

39
00:02:37,335 --> 00:02:40,450
Join a working group, or create your own.

40
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:44,476
In essence: Verana enables trust to scale.

41
00:02:44,476 --> 00:02:49,855
Not just within one ecosystem: across the entire digital economy.

42
00:02:49,855 --> 00:02:53,331
Try it yourself, on the public playground.

43
00:02:53,331 --> 00:02:54,490
Verana dot io.

